---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title="About — SuperChanguito">
  <article class="prose narrow">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>I'm using this site to learn AI-assisted development. I'm building real apps with Claude Code, Gemini, and OpenAI's coding tools and shipping them in public.</p>
    <p>Every project here is free to try or download. If something is useful (or broken), leave a comment on its page. That feedback decides what I build next.</p>
    <p>Find the source for everything on <a href={SITE.github}>GitHub</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
